      "Give them a slow page or a Lighthouse report and ask where they'd start. Strong candidates measure before changing anything and can explain LCP, INP, and CLS in plain terms.",
      "### Can I generate frontend interview questions from a job description?",
      "Yes. [HireBest's free Interview Question Generator](/tools/interview-questions) reads your JD and writes role-specific technical and behavioral questions in under a minute.",
